    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You were never meant to leave this place alive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850890/extras/4bf76b55cca65dc9ca0aea709c033568.avif?t=1755356301\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undead Sentence</strong> is a retro-style <strong>first-person survival horror shooter</strong> set inside a quarantined maximum-security prison, now overrun by the undead. You play as <strong>Derrick Voss</strong>, an inmate who wakes to chaos and must fight to survive while uncovering the truth behind a horrific outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850890/extras/6ec2c33efd6cf87e3cf5e6cc4df71cfc.avif?t=1755356301\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the gritty visuals and atmosphere of PSX-era games, Undead Sentence blends <strong>tense exploration, brutal combat, and environmental storytelling</strong>. Fight your way through <strong>abandoned cell blocks, medical wings, security hubs, and hidden labs</strong>, scavenging weapons, ammo, and health supplies as you go.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850890/extras/f2b55775367b675273feb26f307fa17b.avif?t=1755356301\" width=616 height=154 /></span><br><strong>Survival-Focused FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in close-quarters combat using pistols, shotguns, and improvised weapons. Every bullet counts in this low-ammo, high-stakes horror shooter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro PSX-Inspired Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty, low-poly environments and lo-fi textures create an authentic late-90s horror atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths, hidden areas, and escape routes using clues and surveillance guidance from a mysterious ally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through themed areas like the <strong>cellblock, solitary confinement, infirmary, shower rooms, and guard stations</strong>\u2014each with unique threats and layouts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progressive Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper into the prison, enemies grow stronger, resources become scarcer, and new challenges emerge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth\u2026 or join the undead?</strong></h2>",
