 atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths, hidden areas, and escape routes using clues and surveillance guidance from a mysterious ally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through themed areas like the <strong>cellblock, solitary confinement, infirmary, shower rooms, and guard stations</strong>\u2014each with unique threats and layouts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progressive Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper into the prison, enemies grow stronger, resources become scarcer, and new challenges emerge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth\u2026 or join the undead?</strong></h2>",
